        "original_id": "c8eb8033-eb1c-5531-8ccb-527eb08e999d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Brothers Quay, Stephen Quay, Timothy Quay, Alexandra Shiva, William Tuckett\n- Works: The Chairs, Bombay Eunuch, How to Dance in Ohio, The Sandman\n- Awards: Drama Desk Award for Outstanding Set Design\n- Events: Sundance Film Festival, US Documentary Competition\n\nFacts:\n- Stephen Quay and Timothy Quay were born on June 17, 1947, and are American identical twin brothers known as the Brothers Quay or Quay Brothers.\n- In 1998, the Brothers Quay received the Drama Desk Award for Outstanding Set Design for their work on the play \"The Chairs.\"\n- In 2000, The Brothers Quay and William Tuckett made the dance film \"The Sandman.\"\n- In 2001, Alexandra Elizabeth Shiva's award-winning film was \"Bombay Eunuch.\"\n- In 2015, Alexandra Elizabeth Shiva showed \"How to Dance in Ohio\" at the Sundance Film Festival in the US Documentary Competition.\n- Alexandra Elizabeth Shiva is an American film producer and director.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
