        "text": "Page: Brothers Quay. Sentence: Stephen and Timothy Quay ( ; born June 17, 1947) are American identical twin brothers better known as the Brothers Quay or Quay Brothers.\nPage: Brothers Quay. Sentence: They are also the recipients of the 1998 Drama Desk Award for Outstanding Set Design for their work on the play \"The Chairs\".\nPage: Alexandra Shiva. Sentence: Alexandra Elizabeth Shiva is an American film producer and director.\nPage: Alexandra Shiva. Sentence: \"Bombay Eunuch\" is her 2001 award-winning film, and in 2015 she showed \"How to Dance in Ohio\" at the Sundance Film Festival in the US Documentary Competition.\nPage: The Sandman (2000 film). Sentence: The Sandman is a 2000 dance film made by the Brothers Quay and William Tuckett.",
